OL,3,GNEWSAStrategy will safeguard nature for
OL,4,Agenerations
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore tree planting, wetland restoration
OL,7,Fand drainage work could take place in
OL,8,Fparts of Northamptonshire to "safeguard
OL,9,Fnature for generations to come".
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council has
OL,12,Fapproved its first Local Nature
OL,13,FRecovery Strategy (LNRS) which was
OL,14,Frequired by the Environment Act 2021
OL,15,Fand is the responsibility of all
OL,16,Fauthorities.
OL,18,FIt said the area was one of England's
OL,19,F"most nature-depleted areas" and its
OL,20,Fwildlife sites "are often small, in
OL,21,Fpoor condition, and isolated from one
OL,22,Fanother".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
